# Ephemeral run evidence. These directories hold the events, checkpoints,
# contexts, transcripts, and receipts of individual Wave Gate, panel, and
# orchestration runs. They are audit data for a run in flight, not source:
# committing them would fold a run's own evidence into the change it audits.
.claude/reviews/packets/
.claude/reviews/panel-runs/
.claude/state/
.claude/specs/*/panel-runs/
.claude/**/orchestration-runs/
.claude/**/wave-gate-runs/

node_modules/
